  exerciseText: Fix NullReferenceException
  hintText: Follow the stack trace and then the code path to see where Null is being
    passed in. It is on the itemSOList by default? Is it on the AddItem? Is it on
    the Prefab?
  solutionText: 'inventorySystem.AddItem(null); when it should be adding the ItemSO
    from the ItemHolder

    inventorySystem.AddItem(itemHolder.GetItemSO());'
